277
00:34:30,782 --> 00:34:32,659
Kunci pintu seharusnya di luar.

278
00:34:34,870 --> 00:34:36,538
Pintunya terbuka.

279
00:34:37,038 --> 00:34:39,082
Kau bisa saja pergi jika mau.

280
00:34:49,342 --> 00:34:50,343
Sunhae.

281
