- Angkat dia pada hitungan ketiga.

292
00:36:12,509 --> 00:36:14,135
Satu, dua, tiga.

293
00:36:15,637 --> 00:36:16,638
Hati-hati.

294
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:27,190
Kurasa aku menarik penyuara telinganya.

295
00:36:33,113 --> 00:36:34,573
Kenapa dia memakai penyuara telinga?

296
00:36:36,741 --> 00:36:37,993
Untuk menyemangatinya.

297
00:36:38,076 --> 00:36:39,369
Menyemangatinya?

298
00:36:39,452 --> 00:36:40,620
Ya.

299
00:36:42,372 --> 00:36:43,623
Agar dia bisa bertahan.

300
00:36:44,165 --> 00:36:47,502
Supaya dia tak tersesat
dan mencari cahaya.

301
00:36:49,504 --> 00:36:50,964
Menurutmu dia bisa mendengarnya?

302
00:36:55,719 --> 00:37:00,015
<i>Langit dan orang-oranglah</i>

303
00:37:00,098 --> 00:37:04,436
<i>Yang harus kita lihat dan rasakan</i>

304
00:37:04,519 --> 00:37:08,940
<i>Kita pasti mengalami hari-hari berat</i>

305
00:37:09,024 --> 00:37:13,361
<i>Namun, semua itu
demi mimpi-mimpi baru kita</i>

306
00:37:13,445 --> 00:37:17,782
<i>Pergi menuju</i>

307
00:37:17,866 --> 00:37:21,703
<i>Ke tempat angin berembus</i>

308
00:37:31,254 --> 00:37:35,592
<i>Pergi menuju</i>

309
00:37:35,675 --> 00:37:40,013
<i>Ke tempat matahari bersinar terang</i>

310
00:37:40,096 --> 00:37:44,476
<i>Pergi menuju</i>

311
00:37:44,559 --> 00:37:48,313
<i>Ke tempat angin membawaku</i>

312
00:37:49,231 --> 00:37:53,401
<i>Meski jika ombak datang</i>

313
00:37:53,485 --> 00:37:56,613
<i>Aku akan fokus pada cakrawala</i>

314
00:37:58,365 --> 00:38:00,200
Kenapa bola basket ini ada di sini?

315
00:38:01,576 --> 00:38:03,620
Dia pasti sangat suka basket.

316
00:38:05,664 --> 00:38:07,082
Siapa yang taruh di sini?

317
00:38:09,251 --> 00:38:10,252
Aku.

318
00:38:12,671 --> 00:38:14,297
Aku memberi umpan matang.

319
00:38:21,596 --> 00:38:23,056
Ayo pergi, Semuanya.

320
00:38:25,016 --> 00:38:27,853
Pasien di bangsal lain akan turun ke B3.

321
00:38:27,936 --> 00:38:28,937
Baiklah.

322
00:38:30,522 --> 00:38:33,441
Suster Kim, periksa monitor di sini.

323
00:38:33,525 --> 00:38:34,526
Baiklah.

324
00:38:39,948 --> 00:38:41,241
Sampai nanti.

325
00:38:44,536 --> 00:38:48,456
Pasien kecelakaan lalu lintas ini
tiba kemarin dengan pasien bangsal kita.

326
00:38:48,999 --> 00:38:50,500
Kurasa dia sudah tidak koma.

327
00:38:51,376 --> 00:38:52,377
Apa itu berarti…

328
