Bom,

387
00:45:37,073 --> 00:45:39,951
Yeoreum, Gaeul,

388
00:45:41,036 --> 00:45:44,539
Gyeowool, Eutteum,

389
00:45:45,290 --> 00:45:51,171
Huimang, Suksuk, Teunteun,

390
00:45:51,838 --> 00:45:57,093
<i>Haengbok, Somang, Sarang…</i>

391
00:46:01,473 --> 00:46:02,557
<i>Haetsal…</i>

392
00:46:11,983 --> 00:46:14,152
Itu nama panggilan janin yang umum.

393
00:46:17,239 --> 00:46:21,368
Anak-anak di sini
